Package: internalRmdTools
Title: Utility functions for R Markdown
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Santiago", "del Rey", , "santiago.del.rey@upc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of utility functions to help with R Markdown documents.
    This package is intended to be used internally by the `rmarkdown` package
    and is not meant for general use. It provides functions to simplify
    common tasks in R Markdown documents, such as managing code chunks,
    handling output formats, and more.
License: `use_mit_license()`
Encoding: UTF-8
